<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-15T17:13:34.972Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:13:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi authorities are publicly pledging to prevent the use of Iraqi territory for attacks on Saudi Arabia, while the pro-Iran militia Kataib Hezbollah warned it will target any hostile aircraft over Iraq and a rival armed group said a weapons agreement with Iran remains stalled. Iraq’s Supreme Court declared the Kurdistan Region security law unconstitutional and US firms are assessing air-defence investment in the Kurdistan Region. Human-trafficking networks were dismantled, rescuing newborns, and a weapons and explosives cache was seized in Baghdad’s Husseiniya district. The Iraqi MP warned that a ban on the Waze navigation app could disrupt delivery services. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxONm9md2lxTWQ2OHhpbWV0TGVpVHNvRE94ejRhQmFaejFzOEFwNzF5ZG1YbXI4MDVJQU9UMGtZdEo4dUxmQ25Vc2Q3OU9qM1hWWDg4UTRoX3FSLTRxa1h3OFBFZnR2WGF1OUVtcEtNZ2dtRlpZQkpBdjF1NE9tdk93RGpRaGtfQnJYbktVeUQ4eGlXcjZHR2RmZHQtX1pVNWZ5Yi11TTdZSTFpdHBmcWItR29YM2xrSEVha0ZST2dTTnBFNkE1U2VvWk1rQnU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxNNk9zUC1tcXV3QjNtWjc1MXo3OUlNRkVBdXI4MjJnTDVOWVcyTl8yN1BidVQwUHYwNEpMbnpNSkdKR1ZuUFdnbHlxYmRSVjllb1BhQkJaVjR3cF9keDY0WExwMldDR21HSE9kV1laeF9pR1QzWkJvdUlBN1Nndkp2Wi13VQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;14 News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTFBEXzFhaEZxWUlSSmtlOFM1TGNIWFFXdmMydTlZUWU5VGt2MVctek9LZHpJTkR5c2MzXzA1Wnhfbm9jd3VfZ3d2ZmtYYkZtNFk4YjNV?oc=5&quot;&gt;PUKmedia یەکێتیی نیشتمانیی کوردستان&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxOeGV4SDNqZ3NUSC1hYmJFUkY1bkRaQjRIQ2JjanhiVWxQNkZMZHpONFpTeVBrWlhublB0UFVCd